are shared as described in \code{\link[=summarize_biomass]{summarize_biomass()}}: nodes of the reference,
missing taxonomic levels, life stages, populations, the source and, after a
conversion, those of the conversion models. \code{\link[=summarize_biomass]{summarize_biomass()}} uses
